            {
                "entry_id": "4df257a8-966d-3aa0-a302-69ac2f6d9170",
                "word": "psychopathe",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "e7d1db55-800b-41ba-a053-e16af61aaf71",
                        "entry_id": "4df257a8-966d-3aa0-a302-69ac2f6d9170",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "psychopathes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "05721b61-22ea-3a7f-b227-28d7e735d987",
                        "entry_id": "4df257a8-966d-3aa0-a302-69ac2f6d9170",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Personne atteinte de psychopathie."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "95b550a1-9e1f-4f1f-b603-12c9ae9ec2b0",
                                "sense_id": "05721b61-22ea-3a7f-b227-28d7e735d987",
                                "text": "Il y a ainsi presque toujours dans la scène de crime quelque chose d’individuel et d’unique, comme une signature du criminel ; et c’est particulièrement vrai, ajoutait-il, des crimes atroces ou rituels, de ceux pour lesquels on est naturellement disposé à orienter les recherches vers un psychopathe."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "85d6ac04-8968-472f-9dae-c88d13f03336",
                                "sense_id": "05721b61-22ea-3a7f-b227-28d7e735d987",
                                "text": "La plupart d’entre nous tendront la main à celui qui vient de tomber à l’eau. Un psychopathe ou une personne dominée par la haine regardera peut-être le malheureux se noyer sans lever le petit doigt, voire avec une satisfaction sadique."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "96aca6ff-c2cc-4ce4-9a73-1bea5fc9983f",
                                "sense_id": "05721b61-22ea-3a7f-b227-28d7e735d987",
                                "text": "On pourrait ajouter deux autres films similaires à ce long métrage : Network, de Sidney Lumet (1976), sur un journaliste enragé qui devient le porte-voix de la colère du peuple, et The Joker, de Todd Phillips (2019), sur un psychopathe qui instrumentalise une révolte populaire à des fins personnelles."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "16263989-21c5-4cdf-b7ee-f67d59c05039",
                                "sense_id": "05721b61-22ea-3a7f-b227-28d7e735d987",
                                "text": "Un dangereux psychopathe."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0a086cb0-cf30-4ff2-a350-5df4d1de22e7",
                        "source_entry_id": "4df257a8-966d-3aa0-a302-69ac2f6d9170",
                        "source_sense_id": "05721b61-22ea-3a7f-b227-28d7e735d987",
                        "target_lang_word": "psychopath",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "psychopath",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2ce35d37-749d-3684-ad9b-43892a8fe32c",
                                        "entry_id": "bef7790e-98cc-34e3-b4a6-30aaa3ff3038",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person with a personality disorder indicated by a pattern of lying, cunning, manipulating, glibness, exploiting, heedlessness, arrogance, delusions of grandeur, carelessness, low self-control, disregard for morality, lack of acceptance of responsibility, callousness, and lack of empathy and remorse. Such a person may be especially prone to violent and criminal offenses."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "206657c7-5162-36c1-b410-1f45135470ff",
                                        "entry_id": "bef7790e-98cc-34e3-b4a6-30aaa3ff3038",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person with no moral conscience."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "442b2cc4-69e7-4563-ba3d-4db2bef2d511",
                                                "sense_id": "206657c7-5162-36c1-b410-1f45135470ff",
                                                "text": "Now the real difference between now and then was that Trump wasn't looking to do much of anything positive for the American people as a whole. He mainly enriched himself and his family and gave rich people another tax cut. I think as far as Republicans being psychopaths I would say yes but it's probably a bit more complicated. The party is struggling to message against the policies the Biden administration is working to pass because they are overall popular with the voters. The Republicans would normally talk about fiscal responsibility and harp on the national debt but I think their big business \"donors\" don't want to see the economy stall again so we aren't seeing their normal talking points. So instead they are stoking their base with culture war crap about freedom and Biden becoming an authoritarian."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0f26706c-78b7-357a-a596-264ee7b3e358",
                                        "entry_id": "bef7790e-98cc-34e3-b4a6-30aaa3ff3038",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who perpetrates especially gruesome or bizarre violent acts."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "89dee62a-a5c5-39a3-8f05-9e7ca9aede5a",
                                        "entry_id": "bef7790e-98cc-34e3-b4a6-30aaa3ff3038",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person diagnosed with antisocial or dissocial personality disorder."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e0c422ce-e62a-3efc-bce2-9e1354028dc8",
                                        "entry_id": "bef7790e-98cc-34e3-b4a6-30aaa3ff3038",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person diagnosed with any mental disorder."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
